The indexer (polyphony-xbt) is an architectural descendant of TxPipe's Scrolls
(https://github.com/txpipe/scrolls, Apache-2.0) and is built on the gasket
staged-pipeline framework (https://github.com/construkts/gasket-rs,
Apache-2.0). Metaprotocol parsing builds on the ord project
(https://github.com/ordinals/ord, CC0-1.0). The stack uses maintained forks of
gasket, ord, the TiKV Rust client, and bb8-tikv, published under the
maestro-org GitHub organisation.
